<p class="question-block__q">4. Do a brief examination of conscience, reviewing in your life each of the seven capital sins. You do not need to write the details; simply put next to each one: &laquo;affects me,&raquo; &laquo;affects me a little,&raquo; or &laquo;does not affect me.&raquo;</p>
<p class="question-block__p"><strong>Pride:</strong> ____ | <strong>Avarice:</strong> ____ | <strong>Envy:</strong> ____ | <strong>Wrath:</strong> ____ | <strong>Lust:</strong> ____ | <strong>Gluttony:</strong> ____ | <strong>Sloth:</strong> ____</p>
<p class="question-block__p">Then choose ONE. The one that most affects you. Write a concrete action you will take this week to cultivate the contrary virtue. Be specific: &laquo;be more humble&raquo; does not count. &laquo;Apologize to X&raquo; or &laquo;listen without interrupting Y&raquo; does.</p>
