<section class="content" id="activities">

<h3>Practical Activities</h3>

<h4>A. The Line of Sin and Grace</h4>
<p>Draw a horizontal line on a sheet of paper. At the far left write &laquo;Original Sin (Gen 3).&raquo; At the far right, &laquo;Heaven.&raquo; Now mark important points in salvation history: the Flood, the Tower of Babel, the Covenant with Abraham, the Exodus, King David (with his sin and repentance), the prophets... Arrive at the Cross of Christ &mdash; put it in the center, clearly visible. After the Cross, trace the line upward, toward Heaven. Write on one side, next to the Cross: &laquo;Where sin abounded, grace abounded all the more (Rom 5:20).&raquo;</p>

<h4>B. The Seven Vices and Their Remedies</h4>
<p>Make a two-column table:</p>
<table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:12px 0">
<tr><th style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);text-align:left">Capital Vice</th><th style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);text-align:left">Remedy (virtue + concrete action)</th></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)">Pride</td><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)">Avarice</td><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)">Envy</td><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)"></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)">Wrath</td><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)"></td></tr>
