<tr><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)">Sloth</td><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)"></td></tr>
</table>

<h4>C. Letter to My &laquo;Self&raquo; in Sin</h4>
<p>Think of a situation in which you gave in to sin (it could be something recent or something past). Write a letter from your &laquo;present self&raquo; to your &laquo;self at that moment.&raquo; Do not write to scold yourself. Write to illuminate, with what you have learned in this lesson. What would you say to that person you were? What did you need to hear that you did not hear?</p>
