<h4>D. Preparing for Confession</h4>
<p>Do a guided examination of conscience. Use the Ten Commandments as a guide (if you know them) or these questions:
<em>Have I rejected God in my life? Have I used his name disrespectfully? Have I missed Sunday Mass? Have I disobeyed my parents or just authorities? Have I harmed anyone physically or with words? Have I had impure thoughts or acts? Have I stolen or been unjust? Have I lied or slandered? Have I coveted what belongs to others? Have I desired another person in a disordered way?</em></p>
<p>Write (privately) the sins you want to confess. Then note the date and time of the next available Confession at your parish.</p>

