<div class="bible-passage">
<p>&laquo;If we say we have no sin, we deceive ourselves, and the truth is not in us. If we confess our sins, he is faithful and just, and will forgive our sins and cleanse us from all unrighteousness.&raquo;</p>
<p class="bible-passage__ref">&mdash; 1 John 1:8-9</p>
</div>

