<section class="content">

<h3>Prayer for This Week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord Jesus, my Savior,<br />
look upon me, a sinner,<br />
but do not let me fall into despair.<br />
You who said to the adulterous woman: &laquo;Neither do I condemn you. Go, and sin no more,&raquo;<br />
say the same to me.<br />
Grant me the grace to acknowledge my sins with humility,<br />
and the confidence to draw near to your mercy without fear.<br />
I want to return to the Father's house.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

